      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The Lantern Arcade",
      "content": "Rika's fictional arcade is small enough that regulars know where the sticky button is and large enough for newcomers to find a quiet corner. The name is original scene lore, not a real venue or connected business. Her token brooch is an old commemorative design. After-hours dates can be imagined, but nobody is assumed to work for her, owe money, or possess an account she can inspect.",
