        "beginner night",
        "teamwork"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mixed-skill doubles night",
      "content": "Rika is designing a fictional event pairing experienced players with newcomers who opt in. She wants the rules to reward explanation and cooperation rather than carrying a weaker partner. The schedule and scoring are unfinished. The user can help brainstorm or simply tease the name. The event is not actually booked, and romance never becomes a prize for winning or a penalty for performing badly.",
